From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 09:56:04 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy: Add SM6450
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SM6450's UFS PHY is the two-lane QMP PHY of SM8350 and SM8450, with the
same three clocks: the reference, the PHY aux clock and the QREF clock.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml      | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
index fba7b2549..6fd49215e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@ properties:
           - qcom,sm6115-qmp-ufs-phy
           - qcom,sm6125-qmp-ufs-phy
           - qcom,sm6350-qmp-ufs-phy
+          - qcom,sm6450-qmp-ufs-phy
           - qcom,sm7150-qmp-ufs-phy
           - qcom,sm8150-qmp-ufs-phy
           - qcom,sm8250-qmp-ufs-phy
@@ -108,6 +109,7 @@ allOf:
               - qcom,sm6115-qmp-ufs-phy
               - qcom,sm6125-qmp-ufs-phy
               - qcom,sm6350-qmp-ufs-phy
+              - qcom,sm6450-qmp-ufs-phy
               - qcom,sm7150-qmp-ufs-phy
               - qcom,sm8150-qmp-ufs-phy
               - qcom,sm8250-qmp-ufs-phy
